{"slug":"hh-q-q","ar":"ح ق ق","total":287,"core":"truth; right","forms":[{"ar":"حَقّ","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":247,"gloss":"Truth, right","word":"64","ex":{"s":69,"a":51,"p":2,"ar":["وَإِنَّهُۥ","لَحَقُّ","ٱلْيَقِينِ"],"en":"And indeed, it is the truth of certainty"}},{"ar":"حَقَّ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":20,"gloss":"to be due, come true","word":null,"ex":{"s":84,"a":2,"p":3,"ar":["وَأَذِنَتْ","لِرَبِّهَا","وَحُقَّتْ"],"en":"And has responded to its Lord and was obligated [to do so]"}},{"ar":"أَحَقّ","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":10,"gloss":"more worthy, more entitled","word":null,"ex":{"s":9,"a":62,"p":7,"ar":["يَحْلِفُونَ","بِٱللَّهِ","لَكُمْ","لِيُرْضُوكُمْ","وَٱللَّهُ","وَرَسُولُهُۥٓ","أَحَقُّ","أَن","يُرْضُوهُ","إِن","كَانُوا۟","مُؤْمِنِينَ"],"en":"They swear by Allah to you [Muslims] to satisfy you. But Allah and His Messenger are more worthy for them to satisfy, if they should be believers"}},{"ar":"يُحِقَّ","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":4,"gloss":"to establish as truth","word":null,"ex":{"s":8,"a":8,"p":1,"ar":["لِيُحِقَّ","ٱلْحَقَّ","وَيُبْطِلَ","ٱلْبَـٰطِلَ","وَلَوْ","كَرِهَ","ٱلْمُجْرِمُونَ"],"en":"That He should establish the truth and abolish falsehood, even if the criminals disliked it"}},{"ar":"حَآقَّة","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"the inevitable reality","word":null,"ex":{"s":69,"a":1,"p":1,"ar":["ٱلْحَآقَّةُ"],"en":"The Inevitable Reality"}},{"ar":"ٱسْتَحَقَّ","kind":"verb","form":10,"count":2,"gloss":"to deserve; to be guilty","word":null,"ex":{"s":5,"a":107,"p":5,"ar":["فَإِنْ","عُثِرَ","عَلَىٰٓ","أَنَّهُمَا","ٱسْتَحَقَّآ","إِثْمًا","فَـَٔاخَرَانِ","يَقُومَانِ","مَقَامَهُمَا","مِنَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ٱسْتَحَقَّ","عَلَيْهِمُ","ٱلْأَوْلَيَـٰنِ","فَيُقْسِمَانِ","بِٱللَّهِ","لَشَهَـٰدَتُنَآ","أَحَقُّ","مِن","شَهَـٰدَتِهِمَا","وَمَا","ٱعْتَدَيْنَآ","إِنَّآ","إِذًا","لَّمِنَ","ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ"],"en":"But if it is found that those two were guilty of perjury, let two others stand in their place [who are] foremost [in claim] from those who have a lawful right. And let them swear by Allah, \"Our testimony is truer than their testimony, and we have not transgressed. Indeed, we would then be of the wrongdoers"}},{"ar":"حَقِيق","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"obligated, worthy","word":null,"ex":{"s":7,"a":105,"p":1,"ar":["حَقِيقٌ","عَلَىٰٓ","أَن","لَّآ","أَقُولَ","عَلَى","ٱللَّهِ","إِلَّا","ٱلْحَقَّ ۚ","قَدْ","جِئْتُكُم","بِبَيِّنَةٍ","مِّن","رَّبِّكُمْ","فَأَرْسِلْ","مَعِىَ","بَنِىٓ","إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ"],"en":"[Who is] obligated not to say about Allah except the truth. I have come to you with clear evidence from your Lord, so send with me the Children of Israel"}}],"surahs":[[2,24],[10,23],[7,15],[6,13],[3,12],[5,10],[8,9],[39,8],[40,8],[9,7],[22,7],[23,7],[28,7],[46,7],[4,6],[17,6],[18,6],[34,6],[38,6],[21,5],[42,5],[43,5],[11,4],[13,4],[15,4],[16,4],[30,4],[45,4],[50,4],[69,4],[24,3],[25,3],[31,3],[33,3],[35,3],[41,3],[48,3],[12,2],[14,2],[29,2],[32,2],[36,2],[37,2],[47,2],[51,2],[57,2],[84,2],[19,1],[20,1],[27,1],[44,1],[53,1],[56,1],[60,1],[61,1],[64,1],[70,1],[78,1],[103,1]]}